urrent.start_column;","path":"modules/gdscript/gdscript_parser.cpp","commit_id":"b14954f730781339fd30ee5e09f7bd4dfa35b7be","original_commit_id":"b14954f730781339fd30ee5e09f7bd4dfa35b7be","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"```suggestion\n\tp_function->header_end_line = previous.end_line;\n\tp_function->header_end_column = previous.end_column;\n```\n\nThis solves an edge case when an abstract function is the last thing in the file and there is no trailing new line. In that case `previous` is the last token and there is no current token (so `current` still contains the values from `previous` which leads to the final `\")\"` not being included in the range):\n\n<img width=\"334\" height=\"94\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/cd9395ec-0dfd-42f7-9aa7-5a7dc3f955f6\" />\n","created_at":"2026-05-15T08:46:51Z","updated_at":"2026-05-15T08:47:00Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118552#discussion_r3246984581","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/rep